    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a single cubie (small cube) of the Rubik&apos;s Cube. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each cubie stores the color index of its 6 faces. The cubie itself does not know its spatial position; that is handled by <ref refid="class_cube_state" kindref="compound">CubeState</ref>.</para>
<para>Rotation affects only the ordering of its face colors. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
